B.bDu=new A.al(B.ND,["object",B.bDV],t.t4)
B.bRv=new A.kV("ping","A tool-connection test bench. Call it with an `action` to verify one execution path at a time: `ok` echoes your message back (always succeeds); `fail` fails on purpose (you get an error message to read); `error` fails like a storage outage; `throw` crashes on purpose (you get a generic failure); `long` returns a very long result. Only call this when the user asks you to verify tools or check the connection.",B.bDu,!0,!1,!1,B.jE)
B.bER={base:0,entry:1,query:2,page:3,pageSize:4}
B.bBA=new A.al(B.bJ,["string","Name of the base to browse. Omit to list your bases."],t.w)
