B.bRx=new A.kV("message",'Write your reply into the conversation. These calls are the only way your reply reaches the reader: prose you write outside them is your own thinking and is not the reply. Call it once per part, in the order the parts should appear \u2014 kind "speech" for the words you say, kind "action" for your own movement or stage direction. No lists, no headings, and never a recap of what was just said. Write each part as plain text: the call already names the kind, so never wrap an action in asterisks and never write a kind label like [speech] or [action] yourself. Write your closing line before you stop.',B.bB8,!1,!0,!0,B.jE)
